"Shows a macOS notification when Muxy is not frontmost." = "当 Muxy 不在最前时显示 macOS 通知。";
"Shows app and subprocess CPU and memory usage in the status bar. Disabling it stops the sampling." = "在状态栏中显示应用和子进程的 CPU 与内存占用。禁用后将停止采样。";
"Shows or hides the status bar." = "显示或隐藏状态栏。";
"Shows or hides the window-level controls on the right side of the top bar." = "显示或隐藏顶栏右侧的窗口级控制项。";
"Shows visible togglePanel extension icons in a right-hand rail below the title bar. Other topbar icons stay in the title bar. Off by default." = "将可见的 togglePanel 扩展图标显示在标题栏下方右侧的竖栏中。其他顶栏图标保留在标题栏中。默认关闭。";
"Saved order of visible togglePanel icons on the right-hand rail." = "右侧竖栏中可见 togglePanel 图标的已保存顺序。";
"Shows the project search field whenever the project-focused sidebar is expanded." = "每当以项目为中心的侧边栏展开时显示项目搜索框。";
"Shows the QR code used to pair a mobile device." = "显示用于配对移动设备的二维码。";
"Shows the permanent Home project at the top of the sidebar." = "在侧边栏顶部显示常驻的 Home 项目。";
"Shows Muxy tips at the bottom of the built-in sidebar." = "在内置侧边栏底部显示 Muxy 提示。";
"Shows toast notifications." = "显示浮动提示。";
"Sidebar Vibrancy" = "侧边栏毛玻璃效果";
"Sorts the worktree switcher with the active worktree first, then by most-recently-used." = "对工作树切换器排序，活动工作树优先，然后按最近使用排序。";
