"Nest worktrees inside projects" = "在项目内嵌套工作树";
"Places worktrees under their project in Tab Focused and Agents Focused layouts." = "在\"标签页聚焦\"和\"智能体聚焦\"布局中将工作树放在其项目下。";
"Enable Free idle inactive terminals in Settings → Terminal to reclaim memory. Local terminals without a background session reopen a fresh shell in the same folder; background-session terminals reattach." = "在设置 → 终端中启用\"释放空闲的非活动终端\"以回收内存。没有后台会话的本地终端会在同一文件夹中重新打开一个新的 shell；有后台会话的终端会重新连接。";
"Enable Auto-copy selected text in Settings → Terminal to copy a terminal selection as soon as you release the mouse." = "在设置 → 终端中启用\"自动复制选中内容\"，即可在松开鼠标时立即复制终端选中内容。";
"Command-click a file path in a local terminal, or a link in any terminal, to open it." = "在本地终端中按住 ⌘ 点击文件路径，或点击任意终端中的链接，即可打开它。";
"Right-click normally opens Muxy's terminal menu. If a program running inside the terminal has mouse reporting enabled and receives the click instead, use Shift-right-click." = "右键点击通常会打开 Muxy 的终端菜单。如果终端内运行的程序启用了鼠标报告并接收了该点击，请使用 Shift+右键点击。";
"By default, ⌘⌥↩ maximizes the selected split pane. Press it again to restore the full layout." = "默认情况下，⌘⌥↩ 会最大化选中的分屏窗格。再次按下可恢复完整布局。";
"By default, ⌘⌥ plus an arrow key focuses a neighboring split pane." = "默认情况下，⌘⌥ 加方向键会聚焦相邻的分屏窗格。";
"By default, Control-Tab and Control-Shift-Tab focus the next or previous visible pane across the current layout." = "默认情况下，Control-Tab 和 Control-Shift-Tab 会在当前布局中聚焦下一个或上一个可见窗格。";
"Hold ⌘ and drag inside a terminal to move its pane to another area or create a split." = "按住 ⌘ 并在终端内拖拽，可将该窗格移动到其他区域或创建分屏。";
"Right-click a tab to pin, recolor, rename, or close the tabs to its left, right, or all other tabs." = "右键点击标签页可固定、更改颜色、重命名，或关闭其左侧、右侧或所有其他标签页。";
"By default, ⌘I opens the Composer for multiline text, files, and images that you can send to the focused terminal." = "默认情况下，⌘I 会打开输入面板，用于发送多行文本、文件和图片到聚焦的终端。";
"Use Send Without Enter in the Composer's More menu to send text to the selected target—either the active pane or all split panes—without sending a Return keystroke." = "使用输入面板\"更多\"菜单中的\"不按回车发送\"，可将文本发送到所选目标——活动窗格或所有分屏窗格——而无需发送 Return 按键。";
"With an on-device dictation language installed and microphone and speech recognition access allowed, ⌘⇧I starts dictation by default while the Composer is open. Stop dictation or press Return to insert the transcript at the cursor." = "安装了设备端听写语言并允许麦克风和语音识别访问后，在输入面板打开时，⌘⇧I 默认会开始听写。停止听写或按 Return 可将转写文本插入到光标处。";
"By default, in a browser tab, press ⌘⌥I or choose Inspect Element from the right-click menu to open Web Inspector." = "默认情况下，在浏览器标签页中按 ⌘⌥I 或从右键菜单中选择\"检查元素\"可打开 Web Inspector。";
"Create browser profiles in Settings → Browser to keep cookies and logins separate, or import cookies from Chrome." = "在设置 → 浏览器中创建浏览器配置文件，以分隔 Cookie 和登录信息，或从 Chrome 导入 Cookie。";
"By default, ⌘⌥O searches open tabs, ⌘⌥P projects, ⌘⌥W worktrees, and ⌘⌥S workspaces." = "默认情况下，⌘⌥O 搜索打开的标签页，⌘⌥P 搜索项目，⌘⌥W 搜索工作树，⌘⌥S 搜索工作区。";
"Create reusable commands in Settings → Commands. By default, ⌘⇧P opens their picker." = "在设置 → 命令中创建可复用的命令。默认情况下，⌘⇧P 会打开其选择器。";
"Assign a global shortcut in Settings → Quick Terminal to open it from any app while Muxy runs. Double Shift requires Input Monitoring; its shell stays alive while hidden." = "在设置 → 快速终端中分配全局快捷键，即可在 Muxy 运行时从任意应用打开它。双击 Shift 需要\"输入监控\"权限；其 shell 在隐藏时保持运行。";
"In a local workspace, open Add Project → Recently Removed to restore a removed project whose folder still exists, without changing its files." = "在本地工作区中，打开\"添加项目\"→\"最近移除\"，即可恢复文件夹仍存在的已移除项目，且不会更改其文件。";
"Install the muxy CLI from the Muxy menu to script splits, send keys, and read visible terminal output. [Read the CLI docs](https://muxy.app/docs/features/muxy-cli)." = "从 Muxy 菜单安装 muxy CLI，即可编写脚本控制分屏、发送按键并读取可见的终端输出。[阅读 CLI 文档](https://muxy.app/docs/features/muxy-cli)。";
"Muxy can track supported coding agents and notify you when a turn finishes or needs input. Check Settings → Notifications." = "Muxy 可以跟踪受支持的编码智能体，并在回合完成或需要输入时通知你。请查看设置 → 通知。";
"Try Muxy 2 Beta, rewritten in Rust to be faster, more efficient, and a true multiplexer. It installs as a separate app next to this one. [Download Muxy 2 Beta](https://github.com/muxy-app/muxy/releases?q=v2.0.0-beta-)." = "试用 Muxy 2 Beta，它使用 Rust 重写，速度更快、更高效，是真正的多路复用器。它会作为独立应用安装在此应用旁边。[下载 Muxy 2 Beta](https://github.com/muxy-app/muxy/releases?q=v2.0.0-beta-)。";
"Muxy 2 Beta" = "Muxy 2 Beta";
"Dismiss Muxy 2 Beta" = "忽略 Muxy 2 Beta";
"Download Muxy 2 Beta" = "下载 Muxy 2 Beta";
"Try Muxy 2 Beta" = "试用 Muxy 2 Beta";
"Muxy 2 is rewritten in Rust. It is faster, more efficient, and a true multiplexer. It installs as a separate app next to this one." = "Muxy 2 使用 Rust 重写。它速度更快、更高效，是真正的多路复用器。它会作为独立应用安装在此应用旁边。";
